  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="meta">Springer · 2016 · co-author</span>
      <h3><a class="title" href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-319-27210-8_14">The "Added Value" of Researchers: The Impact of Doctorate Holders on Economic Development</a></h3>
      <p>Career paths of more than 4,000 PhD holders in Brazil, in <i>The Science and Technology Labor Force</i>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="meta">Revista Brasileira de Inovação · 2012 · co-author</span>
      <h3><a class="title" href="https://periodicos.sbu.unicamp.br/ojs/index.php/rbi/article/view/8649041">Avaliação de impactos da Lei de Informática</a></h3>
